    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'22PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 22.08.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2137$66 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 22 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'08'22No. 2137/66 - THURSDAY, AUGUST 22, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A G 30798\u2014 20 (08/2019)\n\n5TH AMENDMENT\n\nService Minute of the Sri Lanka Accountants Service\n\nTHE Service Minute of the Sri Lanka Accountants Service published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1670/33 dated10th of September, 2010 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as amended by the Gazettes ExtraordinaryNo. 1695/15 dated 01st of March 2011, No. 1865/36 dated 06th of June, 2014, No. 1981/99 dated 27th of August 2016and, No. 2070/7 dated 09th of May 2018 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka is amended as follows andthese amended provisions will be made effective from 26th of February 2019, the date on which the Cabinet of Ministersmade the policy decision.\n\nBy Order of the Public Service Commission,\n\nM. A. B. DAYA SENARATH,Secretary,Public Service Commission.\n\n07th August, 2019.\n\n10.1.1.1\n\n(i) Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade III of thecategory of service and earned six (06) salary increments.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'22PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 22.08.20192A\n\n(vi) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediatelypreceding the date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure or performance appraisal.\n\n10.2.1.1"
