    "chunk_text": "(III)Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediately precedingthe date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\n10.2.1\n\n(I)Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade II of thecategory of service and earned six (06) salary increments.\n\nThe following note will be included below the qualifications referred to under 10.2.1.\n\nNote :\n\nThe officers who are to be promoted to Grade II and have completed the qualifications referred to in the amended 10.1.1.1as at 26th of February 2019, the date on which the Cabinet of Ministers made the policy decision and the officers who werepromoted to Grade II prior to such date will be promoted to Grade I from the date they complete a period of 12 years ofactive and satisfactory service in Grade III and II and all other qualifications referred to under 10.2.1 excluding thequalification in 10.2.1 (I).\n\n9 - 242\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
