    "chunk_text": "IV ^w& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'26Part IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 26.08.2019\n\n1 A\n\nwxl 2138$6 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 26 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'08'26No. 2138/6 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 26, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nAnnexure No. 01\n\nNORTH CENTRAL PROVINCE\n\nAmendment of Rules published in the Government Extraordinary Gazette No. 2086/15 of dated 29.08.2018\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me in the Minister in charge of the subject, under Section 289(1) of Municipal CouncilOrdinance (Chapter 252) that should be read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Incidental Provisions) Act, No. 12 of1989 and the power vested in me in the Minister in charge of the subject under Subsection 184(1)(c)(e)(f) of PradeshiyaSahba Act, No. 15 of 1987 and in accordance with powers vested in me as the Governor of North Central Province, I dohereby order to amend the rules published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 2086/15 and dated 29.08.2018 and to implementas following :\n\nThis Rules shall be effected from 1st of April, 2019.\n\nSARATH EKANAYAKE,Governor of North Central Province,North Central Province.At Governor\u2019s Officeof North Central Province,28th March, 2019.\n\n01. Refreshment Allowances and refreshment expenses for Honourable Mayors and Deputy Mayors of theMunicipal Council :\n\nPresent System\n\n3.IMonthly allowance of Rs. 3000.00 can be paid to the Mayor of Municipal Council as refreshmentallowance. The expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - PG 4587 \u2014 20 (2019/08)"
