    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2138$18 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 27 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'08'27No. 2138/18 - TUESDAY AUGUST 27, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE ATTANAGALLAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1)(a) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichWepola Pathirannehelage Gihan Chinthaka the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1)(a) of theaforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that No. - 07 Magalegoda of Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha whobelongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shallbe declared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Rupasinghe Arachchillage Neel Pradeep Rupasinghe to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasingha Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the AttanagallaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Rupasinghe Arachchillage Neel Pradeep Rupasinghe was elected as the member of the No. - 07Magalegoda of Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Attanagalla Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Gampaha,26th August, 2019.\n\n09 - 328\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
