    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'27PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 27.08.20191A\n\nwxl 2138$21 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 27 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'08'27No. 2138/21 - TUESDAY AUGUST 27, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nAppointments & C., by the President\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30553\u2014 382 (08/2019)\n\nNo. 516/2 of 2019\n\nP.S. No. PS/CSA/00/1/6/2\n\nIT is hereby notified that His Excellency the President has been pleased, under Article 44(1) of the Constitution of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, to appoint the following State Ministers with effect from August 05, 2019.\n\nNameOffice\n\n1.Hon. Lucky Jayawardana, MP-State Minister of City Planning, Water Supply andHigher Education\n\n2.Hon. (Ms.) Anoma Gamage, MP-State Minister of Petroleum Resources Development\n\nBy Order of His Excellency,\n\nUDAYA R. SENEVIRATNE,Secretary to the President.\n\nPresidential Secretariat,Colombo 01,August 26, 2019.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'27PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 27.08.20192A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nNOTIFICATION\n\nP.S. No. PS/CSA/00/1/13/12\n\nIT is hereby notified that Hon. Lucky Jayewardana, Member of Parliament, State Minister of City Planning & WaterSupply has resigned his office under Article 46(3)(b) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of SriLanka, with effect from August 05, 2019.\n\nBy Order of His Excellency,\n\nUDAYA R. SENEVIRATNA,Secretary to the President.\n\nPresidential Secretariat,Colombo 01,August 26, 2019.\n\nNOTIFICATION\n\nP.S. No. PS/CSA/00/1/13/12"
