    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2138/26 - 2019 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.08.28\n\nNo. 2138/26 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: KDS/PDB/4/3/2/4. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2015/WS /127.\n\nI, do hereby give notice that the Government intends to acquire the following land for a public purpose, under sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460), as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964.\n\nDescription of the acquired Area:\n\nTwo allotment of land, stated as Lot No. 1 and 2 with extent of about 0.0078 Hectare, depicted in the preliminary Plan Maha/6918, surveyed and prepared by the superintendent of surveyor of Kandy District and situated in Aluthgama Mahakumbure Gammedda Village in Pallegampaha Korale minor Division of Pathadumbara division in Kandy District Central Province.\n\nLot No. 1 - Name of the Land: -; Extent: 0.0074 Hectare\n\nBoundaries by : North: Allotment 127 of PP/A/1742, Allotments 1 and 2 of PP/Maha 6917; East: Allotment 2; South: Allotment 127 of PP/A/1742; West: Road\n\nName and Addressess of Claimants: The Government Lot No. 2 - Name of the Land:-; Extent: 0.0004 Hectare Boundaries by : North: Allotments 1 and 2 of PP/Maha/6917, East: Allotment 107 PP/A/1742; South: Allotments 107 and 127 of PP/A/1742; West: Allotment 01 Name and Addresses of Claimants : The Government"
