    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2138/28 - 2019 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.08.28\n\nNo. 2138/28 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, AUGUST, 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT( CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: Ambako/3/4/A/122-04Volume.\n\nLand Ministry Reference No.: LD/2003/VEP/493.\n\nI hereby give notice, that the notice published by me, under the above heading in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1416/33 and dated on 28th October 2005 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka is amended by removing the dates therein and substituting them as follows:\n\nThe Details of Old Gazette :\n\nThe land called Miyanakolathanna alias Alliwatta of total extent about 3.1812 Hectares, shown lots No. 207, 208, 209, 210 and 211 in F. V. P. 106 Supplement 12 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Ginigathena in the 315A Ginigathena Grama Nildhari Division of the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ambagamuwa Koralaya, in the District of Nuwaraeliya.\n\nClaimant : 1. Watawala Plantation Ltd, No. 228, Mannapperuma Building, Galle Road, Colombo 07.\n\n02. Mrs. W. M. Leelawathie and Others, No. 23, Nawalapitiya Road, Ginigathena.\n\n03. Mr. W. G. Winsent, Bandaranayake Mawatha, Ginigathena.\n\nAmendment as Follows: The land called Miyanakolathanna alias Alliwatta of total extent about 1.0627 Hectare, shown lots No. 242, 243, 244, 246, 247, 249, 251 in F. V. P. 106 Supplement 20 of Sheet No. 23 dated 2018.02.22 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Ginigathena in the 315A Ginigathena Grama Niladhari Division of the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ambagamuwa Koralaya, in the District of Nuwaraeliya.\n\n1. Lot No. \u2018242\u2019-Total Extent of about 0.0502 Hectare.\n\nNorth: Lot No. 243, 245 and 244; East: Lot No. 243, 245 and 244; South: Lot No. 3 and 9; West: Lot No. 3 and 9.\n\nClaimants: Late Mrs. W. M. Leelawathie, No. 23, Nawalapitiya Road, Ginigathena."
