    "chunk_text": "North: Lot No. 116, 120, 121, 122, 123 and 124; East: Lot No. 121, 122, 123 and Lot 124; South: Lot No. 247 and 250; West: Lot No. 247, 250 and 116.\n\nClaimant: Late Mrs. W. M. Leelawathie, No. 23, Nawalapitiya Road, Ginigathena.\n\n07. Lot No. \u2018251\u2019 Total extent of about 0.1377 Hectares\n\nClaimant: Late Mrs. W. M. Leelawathie, No. 23, Nawalapitiya Road, Ginigathena.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to\n\nappear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Ambagamuwa Koralaya on the 09th day of October, 2019 at 1.00 p. m. and are are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 25th day of September 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\ngfg R. T. P. SUMANASEKARA, Divisional Secretary, Ambagamuwa Koralaya.\n\n23rd August 2019, Divisional Secretariat Ambagamuwa Koralaya. 09-381\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT( CHAPTER 460)\n\nNo. 28 of 1964\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nRef. No. THI/LND/L2/ACQVI/137.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for the public purpose mentioned below: Description of the land to be acquired: Following allotment of land depicted in Preliminary Survey Plan No. MR2804 situated in the village of Komangoda in the Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division of Komangoda 344, in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thihagoda, Matara District.\n\nLot No. 1\n\nLand Name: Thiraniyawatta; Description: Home garden, Permanent Building and mixed crop cultivation; Extent: 1.3281 Hectares."
