    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'30PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.08.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2138$36 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 30 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'08'30No. 2138/36 - FRIDAY AUGUST 30, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4632\u2014 20 (08/2019)\n\nUVA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nUva Provincial Council Draft Roads Statute (Amendment) of No..... of 2019 of the Provincial Council of theUva Province\n\nI, do hereby present the draft of the above mentioned Statute proposed to be implemented in the Provincial Council of theUva Province as follows for public opinions.\n\nIt is noticed that this draft is forwarded to the Provincial Council of the Uva Province for approval after 14 daysfrom the publication of this notice in the Extraordinary Gazette. If you intend to present any opinion on the facts of thisStatute, such opinion shall be submitted to me in writing within 14 days of this notice to the following address.\n\nAKALAN SENTHIL THONDAMAN,Minister of Road Development, Housing, Water Supply,Estate Infrastructure, Cooperative and Tamil Medium Education,Provincial Council,Uva Province.\n\nMinistry of Road Development, Housing, Water Supply,Estate Infrastructure, Cooperative and Tamil Medium Education,At the Minister\u2019s Office,R. H. Gunawardena Mawatha,Badulla,On 21st August, 2019.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'30PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.08.20192A"
