    "chunk_text": "Ministry of Road Development, Housing, Water Supply,Estate Infrastructure, Cooperative and Tamil Medium Education,At the Minister\u2019s Office,R. H. Gunawardena Mawatha,Badulla,On 21st August, 2019.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'30PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.08.20192A\n\n02) Section 3 of the Statute of Uva Provincial Road No. 02 of 2010 (hereinafter referred as \u201cthemain Statute\u201d) shall be replaced with following new subsection and, it shall come into operationas subsection 3 of the main Statute.\n\n3.(1) A certain road, in accordance with the powers vested by subsection 6 of Section 6 can bedeclared as belonging to the Uva Provincial Council by the Minister in charge of UvaProvincial Road subject (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Minister\u201d) through orders publishedin the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. Every such road shouldbe graded as a road of \u201cC\u201d, \u201cD\u201d or \u201cR\u201dclass, also all the roads known as \u201cE\u201d in the mainStatute should be hereinafter referred as \u201cR\u201d class roads.\n\n(2) Criteria for grading provincial roads can be enacted by the Minister by means of orders.\n\n03) (a), (b) and (c) subsections of subsection (1) of section 26 of the main Statute is replaced withthe following new subsection and, it shall be enforced as (a) and (b) under 26(1) of the mainStatute.\n\n1. By replacing (a), (b) and (c) paragraph of subsection (1) of that section with followingsubsection :-\n\n(1) (a) in respect of a road declared by the Minister of Road as a provincial road, thelimit of constructing buildings in accordance with the distance decided by theProvincial Road Director, towards both sides from the the road center line ofthat road and the weight limit of the vehicle with total weight loaded, includingmaterials, people and animals should be published in the Gazette by theProvincial Road Director."
