    "chunk_text": "wxl 2138$39 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 30 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'08'30\n\nNo. 2138/39 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 30, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30852 - 29 (08/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS\n\nAMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: DS/GFG/L&L/05/128.\n\nMinistry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms\n\nRef. No. : 4-3/11/2018/UD/148.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the land described below for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nAllotments of land in total extent 0.0107 Hectare depictedin below names and extents as Lot 437, 440, 441, 444, 445 and448 in sheet No. 12 of Block No. 04 of Cadastral MapNo. 810018 prepared by the Survey General situated in thevillage of Milidduwa in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 101B.Milidduwa, within the Municipal Council limit of Galle in the\n\nDivisional Secretary's Division of Four Gravets Galle in Districtof Galle, Southern Province. The names and extents of aboutnamed lots are as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 437Name of the land: Doowewatta; Description: Home gardena mix cultivation available; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:Amaradasa Jayarathna; Extent: About 0.0006 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 440Name of the land: Doowewatta; Description: Home gardenand Part of a tempory building available; Claimant: State;Original Claimant: M. K. Anusha Lasanthi; Extent: About 0.0018Hectare."
