    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 30190\u2014 27 (08/2019)\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KATTANKUDY URBANCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Kattankudy Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the National Front For Good Governance, the recognized political party towhich Ahamed Lebbe Muhammadu Ilmy the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member of National Front For Good Governance who belongs to such party and isnot disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as amember within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Paikkeer Mohaideen Muhammadu Irzath to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Rajendra Saseelan, Returning Officer of the Kattankudy Urban Council, acting in termsof Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Paikkeer MohaideenMuhammadu Irzath was selected as the member of the Kattankudy Urban Council.\n\nR. SASEELAN,Returning Officer,Kattankudy Urban Council.District Election Office,Batticaloa,30th August, 2019.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
