    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'02PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 02.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2139$1 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 02 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'09'02No. 2139/1 - MONDAY SEPTEMBER 02, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nCUSTOMS NOTIFICATION (GENERAL)\n\nCustoms Ordinance (Chapter 235)\n\nRATES OF EXCHANGE\n\nIT is hereby notified that by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 17 of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235)I, P. S. M. Charles, Director General of Customs, determine that with effect from 02nd September, 2019, all duties of Customsas well as other charges, penalties and forfeitures incurred under the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235), shall be paid andreceived at the Rates of Exchange set out in the Schedule.\n\nThe notification relating to the Rates of Exchange published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2138/2 of 26th August,2019 is hereby rescinded and the said Rates of Exchange are Scheduled to be rescinded by a similar notification to bepublished on or before 08th September, 2019.\n\nP. S. M. CHARLES,Director General of Customs.Sri Lanka Customs,Colombo 11,30th August, 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n1A - G 30856 \u2014 23 (08/2019)\n\nDGC. A 877/PL 305.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lkN. B. - The Gazette Extraordinary Series No. 2138/1 ends with 2138/49\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'02PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 02.09.20192A\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nRATES OF EXCHANGE EFFECTIVE FROM 02ND SEPTEMBER 2019 TO 08TH SEPTEMBER 2019\n\nSerialCountr