    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2139/8 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 02 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf- 2019.09.02\n\nNO. 2139/8 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 02, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (Chapter 460)\n\nMy No. : 4 - 3/1 (Appoinment\u2014Acquisitions) Hon. Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms has appointed the below named officer in terms of the provisions of the Land Acquisition Act, as an Acquiring Officer to function under the directives of the Divisional Secretary concerned for land acquisitions made for Phase III of the Central Expressway Project. Name of the Officer Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Duration of appointment 1. Mrs. H. B.M.W.H. K. Abesinghe Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division from 24.01.2019 for a period of (Assistant Divisional Secretary, - Mawathagama Two years ahead. Mawathagama) W. H. KARUNARATHNE, Secretary, Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Avenue, Battaramulla.\n\n21.08.2019 09 \u2013 523\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nG 30864 \u2014 17 (2019/09)"
