    "chunk_size_bytes": 2115,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2139/16 - 2019 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 02 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.09.02\n\nNo. 2139/16 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER, 02, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: NCP/HG/L02/2544. Land and Land Development Ministry\u2019s Ref.No.:\n\n4/3/9/2012/WS/54. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the under mentioned lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Lands to be Acquired::\n\nThe two allotments of land described below are called and known as Lot Nos. 7662 Nagalakanda and 7664 Minneriya Kele in Total extent 0.1368 Hectare depicted in the Sheet No. 710 in the inset 552 in the Plan F. C. P. 09 dated 20.12.2013 Surveyed and made by the Surveyor General, located in the village of Minneriya in the Sinhala Pattuwa Minor Division in the Hingurakgoda Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in the District of Plolonnaruwa in the North Central Province and bounded:\n\nLot No. 7662 Name of the land: Nagalakanda; Extent of Land: 0.0637 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries - On the North by: Lots 7663 and 4301; On the East by: Lots 4301 and 3753; On the South by: Lots 3753 and 7663; On the West by: Lots 7663.\n\nName and Address of Claimant: Mr. B. L Gunarathna Close to Minneriya Water Treatment Plant\n\nLot No. 7664 Name of land: Minneriya Kele; Extent ofLand: 0.0731 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries- On the North by: Lots 7663 and 7665; On the East by: Lot 7665; On the South by: Lots 7665 and 3753; On the West by: Lots 3753, 7662 and 7663.\n\nName and address of claimant: Mr. B. L. Gunarathna Close to Minneriya Water Treatment Plant All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Hingurakgoda Divisional Secretariat, on the 30th September 2019.\n\nIn addition you are hereby requested to notify to me"
  },
