    "chunk_text": "Name and address of claimant: Mr. B. L. Gunarathna Close to Minneriya Water Treatment Plant All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Hingurakgoda Divisional Secretariat, on the 30th September 2019.\n\nIn addition you are hereby requested to notify to me\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30867 - 17 (2019/09)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.09.02 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 02.09.2019\n\n2019, the nature of their interest in the land, the\n\nparticulars of their claims for compensation for the\n\nacquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation\n\nand the details of the computation of such amount. Deeds\n\nin respect of claims should be submitted at the inspection.\n\ngfg\n\nR. M. D. P. PUSHPAKUMARI, Divisional Secretary, Hingurakgoda.\n\nHingurakgoda Divisional Secretariat, 30th August 2019.\n\n06-526\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
