    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2139$25 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 03 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'03No. 2139/25 - TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nL.D.B 21/78(x) (A)\n\nUNIVERSITIES ACT, No. 16 OF 1978\n\nOrder under Section 25A\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25 A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul Rauff Hakeem,the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, having obtained a report under section 70C of theaforesaid Act, in respect of the Esoft Metro Campus (Private) Limited, a Company incorporated in Sri Lanka under theCompanies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number PV 94112 and first registered on 23.08.2013 andamalgamated on 02.02.2018, located at No. 03, De Fonseka Place, Colombo 04, do by this Order and subject to theconditions specified in Schedule I hereto, recognize the Esoft Metro Campus (Pvt) Limited as a Degree Awarding Institutefor the purpose of developing Higher Education therein, leading to the award of the Degree specified in Column I of theSchedule II hereto, of which the abbreviation is set out in the corresponding entry in Column II of the Schedule II hereto:-\n\nSCHEDULE I\n\nCONDITIONS\n\n1.Esoft Metro Campus (Private) Limited shall conduct the degree programme relevant to the Degreespecified in Schedule II hereto, only at No. 03, De Fonseka Place, Colombo 04."
