    "chunk_text": "3. Esoft Metro Campus (Private) Limited is allowed to offer the Degree specified in Schedule II hereto,only for a period of five (5) years from the date of publication of this Order, subject to the enrollment ofstudents, enabling them to complete said degree within the prescribed five (5) years.\n\n5. Esoft Metro Campus (Private) Limited is allowed to offer the Degree specified in Schedule II hereto, subjectto the programme re-review to be conducted by the specified Authority.\n\n6. Esoft Metro Campus (Private) Limited shall, when admitting students for the degree programme relavantto the Degree specified in Schedule II hereto, in respect of the Bachelor of Information TechnologyHonours, adhere to the minimum entry qualifications of three (3) simple passes (\u2018S\u2019) passes in any subjectstream in one and the same sitting at the GCE (Advanced Level) Examination or equivalent.\n\nSCHEDULE II\n\nColumn IColumn II\n\nDegreeAbbreviations for the Degree\n\nBachelor of Information Technology HonoursBIT (Honours)\n\nA. IBATHUL RAUFF HAKEEMMinister of City Planning, Water Supply andHigher Education.Colombo,30th August, 2019.\n\n09 - 559"
