    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'03PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.09.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER PROVISO (a) TO SECTION 38\n\nOrder No. 172 of 2019\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/7/2018/HW/382.Acq. Officer Ref. No.: RBK/LAN/AQURE/A3/111\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms do hereby direct theAcquiring Officer or any other officer authorized by him referred toin Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of theland specified in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of thatSchedule.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.2nd September, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Rambukkana.\n\n2. Description of the land.\u2013 The allotments of land described inbelow names and depicted in the Surveyor-General\u2019s Advance TracingNo. KE/RMB/2018/285 dated 28.02.2019 situated in the Village ofKadawattiya (F.V.P 141) in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 3G ofNattambhura in the Minor Division of Kinigoda Korale in theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division Rambukkana in Kagalle District ofSabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Bamunumullewatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0018 HectareNorth: Bamunumullewatta, Road and Lot B; East: Lot B; South:Road and Bamunumullewatta; West: Bamunumullewatta.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Extent: 0.0024 HectareNorth: Bamunumullewatta and Lot C; East: Lot C; South: Road,Bamunumullewatta and Lot A; West: Lot A, Bamunumullewatta andRoad."
